            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Skyline Builders announces proposed 10-for-1 proposed share consolidation",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Skyline Builders (SKBL) announced that on August 24, 2025, its Board of Directors approved a proposal to consolidate the Company\u2019s authorized, issued, and outstanding shares. The proposal will be presented for shareholder approval at an upcoming extraordinary general meeting. Under the proposal to be presented at the upcoming extraordinary general meeting, shareholders will be asked to approve the consolidation of the Company\u2019s authorized, issued, and outstanding shares at a ratio of ten ordinar",
